      "created_at": "2020-08-14T07:37:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-08-14T07:37:00Z",
      "body": "we have ZERO intentions of using doh, in aperfect world with no scammers and malware, then it wouldnt matter, but we are far from perfect world and need to intercept domains to protect our users and we always will. \r\nin this country doh is a backwards step in privacy we have strong privacy laws already, even with our  meta data retention ;aw it explicitly forbids DNS and web traffic\r\n\r\ndoesnt matter no more after Neils turse comment he makes it clear we need to seek alternative method for updating LE certs now since he doesnt care what his users think.",
